<section class="tab {{tab.cssClass}} elemental-concepts-tab" data-tab="{{tab.id}}" data-group="{{tab.group}}">
  <header class="iw-element-page-heading"><h2><img class="iw-element-heading-art" src="{{jj2.tabImages.concepts}}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28">Conceitos elementais</h2><span>Treinamento e compreensão</span></header>
  <div class="iw-element-resources" aria-label="Recursos para treinamento">
    <div><span>Pontos de Cultivo</span><strong>{{#if (and elemental.isNpc elemental.canGrant)}}<input type="number" name="system.cultivation.points" value="{{elemental.pt}}" min="0" step="1" data-dtype="Number" aria-label="Pontos de Cultivo disponíveis">{{else}}{{elemental.pt}}{{/if}}</strong><small>Para treinos e avanços</small></div>
    <div><span>Qi Refinado</span><strong>{{elemental.qi}}</strong><small>Custo diário de treino</small></div>
    <div><span>Iluminação</span><strong>{{#if (and elemental.isNpc elemental.canGrant)}}<input type="number" name="system.cultivation.illumination" value="{{elemental.illumination}}" min="0" step="1" data-dtype="Number" aria-label="Pontos de Iluminação">{{else}}{{elemental.illumination}}{{/if}} <small>PI</small></strong><small>Reduz a CD e o custo em PC</small></div>
  </div>
  <details class="iw-element-help iw-concept-adjustments" data-element-section="settings"><summary>Treinamento e ajustes {{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="collapse"}}</summary><div>  <div class="iw-element-settings">
    <label>Especialização elemental<select data-element-setting="focus" {{#unless elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><option value="" {{#unless elemental.focus}}selected{{/unless}}>Sem especialização</option>{{#each elemental.focusOptions}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select><small>Um único elemento permite aprender os graus um reino antes.</small></label>
    <label>Conversão de dano<select data-element-setting="mode" {{#unless elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each elemental.modeOptions}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select><small>Aplica a conversão aprendida; os bônus de ataque continuam próprios de cada habilidade.</small></label>
  </div>
  <details class="iw-element-help" data-element-section="help"><summary>Regras do treinamento {{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="collapse"}}</summary><div>
    <p>Role <strong>Controle de Qi (Constituição)</strong>, usando somente atributo e proficiência ou maestria. Não se aplicam vantagens, bônus externos, sucesso automático ou rerrolagens.</p>
    <p>O custo em PC é pago uma vez por tentativa; o Qi Refinado é pago em cada dia. Em caso de sucesso, o calendário acompanha os dias restantes e concede o nível ao terminar. Uma falha gasta apenas o dia atual. Após três falhas no mesmo nível, as próximas tentativas não custam PC.</p>
    <p>A partir do 3º nível, confirme a Matriz elemental ou o Núcleo de Besta usado no treino. Cada PI reduz a CD e o custo em PC em 3. Corpo no nível 7 reduz a CD em 4.</p>
    <p>Inicial exige Formação de Núcleo; Dominada, Mar Divino; Perfeição, Lorde Divino. A especialização em um único elemento antecipa esses requisitos em um reino. Há um limite de {{elemental.maxAbilities}} habilidades aprendidas e apenas uma habilidade única de nível 10, que exige as demais habilidades de seu elemento dominadas.</p>
    <p>Histórico: {{elemental.spent}} PC em avanços e {{elemental.lost}} PC em tentativas que falharam.</p>
  </div></details>
  <div class="iw-element-general">
    <div><strong>Treinamento geral</strong><span>{{elemental.general.days}} / 10 dias para receber 1 PC</span><small>{{#if elemental.general.paused}}{{elemental.general.reason}}{{else}}Não pode ocorrer junto a outro treinamento.{{/if}}</small></div>
    <button type="button" data-action="toggleGeneralElementalTraining" {{#unless elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if elemental.general.active}}Encerrar treino geral{{else}}Iniciar treino geral{{/if}}</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="exchangeCultivationTalent" {{#unless elemental.canExchange}}disabled{{/unless}}>10 PC por Talento de Qi</button>
  </div>
</div></details>
  {{#if elemental.frost}}<aside class="iw-element-general"><div><strong>Geada: {{elemental.frost}} acúmulo(s)</strong><span>Penalidade em ataques e salvaguardas de Agilidade.</span></div><button type="button" data-action="removeElementalFrost" {{#unless elemental.canRemoveFrost}}disabled{{/unless}}>Remover 1 acúmulo · 1 Qi Refinado</button></aside>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.frozenReason}}<p class="iw-element-note">{{elemental.frozenReason}}</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.vortexDebt}}<p class="iw-element-note">Vortex regional · {{elemental.vortexDebt}} níveis de exaustão inevitável. Um nível é recuperado por descanso longo de duração dobrada.</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.vortexPending.length}}<p class="iw-element-note">Vortex regional · a exaustão será aplicada 2 horas após cada uso registrado.</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.constitutionDebt}}<p class="iw-element-note">Recuperação em Massa · {{elemental.constitutionDebt}} Constituição pendente(s). Recupera 1 ponto por dia ao concluir um descanso longo.</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.localTimeLabel}}<p class="iw-element-note">{{elemental.localTimeLabel}}</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.woodHeart.exists}}
  <aside class="iw-element-general iw-element-heart" aria-label="Coração de Madeira">
    <div>
      <strong>Coração de Madeira · {{elemental.woodHeart.label}}</strong>
      {{#if elemental.woodHeart.regenerating}}<span>Renascimento em {{elemental.woodHeart.rebirthDays}} dia(s) · PV e Qi total completos</span>{{/if}}
      {{#if elemental.woodHeart.awaitingManual}}<span>O narrador confere o prazo de 1/100 da vida para recriar o núcleo.</span>{{/if}}
      {{#if elemental.woodHeart.prepared}}<span>O núcleo será consumido por uma morte real. Zero PV, sozinho, não ativa o renascimento.</span>{{/if}}
      <small>{{elemental.woodHeart.qiSacrificed}} Qi máximo ainda sacrificado{{#if elemental.woodHeart.constitutionSacrificed}} · 1 Constituição retorna em {{elemental.woodHeart.constitutionDays}} dia(s) do calendário{{else}} · Constituição recuperada{{/if}}</small>
    </div>
    {{#if elemental.woodHeart.canConfirmDeath}}<button type="button" data-action="confirmWoodHeartDeath">Confirmar morte · Narrador</button>{{/if}}
    {{#if elemental.woodHeart.canRestore}}<button type="button" data-action="restoreWoodHeart">Recriar núcleo · Narrador</button>{{/if}}
  </aside>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.canPositionOldOrbs}}<button type="button" data-action="positionExistingElementalOrbs">Posicionar conjunto de orbes existente · Narrador</button>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.runtimeCount}}<details class="iw-element-help" data-element-section="runtime"><summary>Efeitos e preparações · {{elemental.runtimeCount}} {{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="collapse"}}</summary><div>
  {{#if elemental.activeEffects}}<section class="iw-element-active" aria-label="Efeitos elementais ativos"><h3>Efeitos ativos</h3><div>{{#each elemental.activeEffects}}<article><strong>{{label}}</strong><span>{{value}}</span><button type="button" data-action="endElementalEffect" data-effect="{{key}}" aria-label="Encerrar {{label}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="close"}}</button></article>{{/each}}</div></section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.orbs}}<section class="iw-element-grants iw-element-orbs" aria-label="Orbes ativos"><h3>Orbes de luz <small>18 m por turno · mover até marcador</small></h3><div class="iw-element-orb-grid">{{#each elemental.orbs as |orb|}}<button type="button" data-action="moveElementalOrb" data-orb="{{orb.id}}" aria-label="Mover orbe {{orb.index}} até um marcador" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><span>Orbe</span><strong>{{orb.index}}</strong></button>{{/each}}</div></section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.illusions}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Ilusões"><h3>Ilusões ativas</h3>{{#each elemental.illusions as |illusion|}}<article><div><strong>{{illusion.label}}</strong><span>{{#if illusion.count}}{{illusion.count}} · {{illusion.sizeLabel}}{{/if}}{{#if illusion.areaM2}}{{illusion.areaM2}} m²{{/if}}</span><small>{{illusion.description}}{{#if illusion.sound}} · Sons: {{illusion.sound}}{{/if}}</small></div><div>{{#if @root.elemental.canPlaceAreas}}<button type="button" data-action="reviewElementalIllusion">Reconhecimento</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="endElementalIllusion" data-illusion="{{illusion.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Encerrar</button></div></article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.projections}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Projeções"><h3>Projeções</h3>{{#each elemental.projections as |copy|}}<article><div><strong>{{copy.label}}</strong><span>{{copy.tokenCount}} projeção(ões) no mapa · {{#if (eq copy.kind "illusionDouble")}}Qi próprio{{else}}ações e Qi compartilhados{{/if}}</span></div>{{#if copy.canReview}}<button type="button" data-action="reviewElementalProjectionRecognition" data-projection="{{copy.id}}">Reconhecimento · Narrador</button>{{/if}}{{#if (eq copy.kind "illusionDouble")}}<button type="button" data-action="openElementalProjection" data-projection="{{copy.id}}">Abrir duplo</button>{{/if}}</article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.realms}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Reinos Místicos"><h3>Reinos Místicos</h3>{{#each elemental.realms as |realm|}}<article><div><strong>{{#if realm.name}}{{realm.name}}{{else}}Reino Místico{{/if}}</strong><span>Cultivo de origem {{realm.originalCultivation.level}} · raio de {{realm.radiusKm}} km{{#if realm.qiCeiling}} · teto de Qi {{realm.qiCeiling}}{{/if}}</span>{{#if realm.miniaturized}}<small>Miniaturizado · pode ser transportado</small>{{/if}}{{#if realm.description}}<small>{{realm.description}}</small>{{/if}}</div><div><button type="button" data-action="configureElementalRealm" data-realm="{{realm.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Configurar reino</button></div></article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.history}}<aside class="iw-element-general"><div><strong>Rewind · histórico do corpo</strong><span>{{#if (and elemental.history.available (eq elemental.history.pending.length 0))}}Estado de uma hora atrás registrado. A ativação mostra a prévia de restauração e o custo de Qi total.{{else}}Aguardando uma hora de histórico completo real do corpo e dos consumos.{{/if}}</span></div></aside>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.preparations}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Preparações elementais"><h3>Preparações e efeitos do calendário</h3>{{#each elemental.preparations as |job|}}<article><div><strong>{{job.label}}</strong><span>{{#if (eq job.status "preparing")}}Preparando · {{job.remainingSeconds}} segundos restantes{{else}}{{#if (eq job.status "ready")}}Preparação concluída · defina a área ou destino com o narrador{{else}}Ativo{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if job.maturedDays}} · {{job.maturedDays}} dias de maturação{{/if}}{{#if job.transitRounds}} · trânsito de {{job.transitRounds}} rodadas{{/if}}</span></div>{{#if job.transit}}<small>{{#if (eq job.transit.status "moving")}}Chegada em conferência; não repita o pagamento.{{else}}Travessia em curso · chegada após três rodadas{{/if}}</small>{{else}}{{#if (and @root.elemental.canPlaceAreas (eq job.kind "spaceRip"))}}<button type="button" data-action="beginElementalTransit" data-job="{{job.key}}" {{#if (eq job.status "preparing")}}disabled{{/if}}>Destino e travessia</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if (and @root.elemental.canPlaceAreas (eq job.kind "timeFreeze"))}}<button type="button" data-action="configureElementalArea" data-record="{{job.key}}" data-record-type="calendar">Área no mapa</button>{{/if}}</article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.timeZones}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Zonas temporais"><h3>Zonas Slow/Quick</h3>{{#each elemental.timeZones as |zone|}}<article><div><strong>{{zone.flowLabel}} ×{{zone.multiplier}}</strong><span>{{zone.occupantCount}} ocupante(s) registrados</span><small>Dias locais · prevalece a zona mais forte</small></div><div>{{#if zone.canManage}}<button type="button" data-action="editElementalTimeZone" data-zone="{{zone.id}}">Ocupantes</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="endElementalTimeZone" data-zone="{{zone.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Encerrar zona</button></div></article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.prisonUpkeep}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Manutenção de prisões"><h3>Prisões mantidas</h3>{{#each elemental.prisonUpkeep as |prison|}}<article><div><strong>{{prison.label}}{{#if prison.targetName}} · {{prison.targetName}}{{/if}}</strong><span>{{prison.investedQi}} / 500 Qi investidos</span><small>{{#if prison.permanent}}Permanente · sem manutenção{{else}}20 PQ no início de cada turno{{/if}}</small></div>{{#unless prison.permanent}}<button type="button" data-action="endElementalPrisonUpkeep" data-upkeep="{{prison.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Encerrar manutenção</button>{{/unless}}</article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if elemental.constructs}}<section class="iw-element-grants iw-element-constructs" aria-label="Estruturas elementais"><h3>Estruturas elementais</h3>{{#each elemental.constructs as |record|}}<article><div><strong>{{record.label}}</strong><span>{{#if record.hp}}{{record.hp.value}} / {{record.hp.max}} PV{{/if}}{{#if record.armorClass}} · CR {{record.armorClass}}{{/if}}</span>{{#if record.description}}<small>{{record.description}}</small>{{/if}}</div><div>{{#if @root.elemental.canPlaceAreas}}<button type="button" data-action="configureElementalArea" data-record="{{record.id}}" data-record-type="construct">Área no mapa</button>{{/if}}{{#if (and record.hp record.canDamage)}}<button type="button" data-action="damageElementalConstruct" data-construct="{{record.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Dano na estrutura</button>{{/if}}{{#if record.canEnd}}<button type="button" data-action="endElementalConstruct" data-construct="{{record.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Encerrar</button>{{else}}{{#if record.eternal}}<span>Prisão eterna</span>{{/if}}{{/if}}</div></article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
  </div></details>{{/if}}
  <div class="iw-concept-atlas">
    <nav class="iw-concept-navigation" aria-label="Elementos">
      {{#each elemental.groups as |group|}}<section><h3>{{group.label}}</h3><div>{{#each group.elements as |element|}}<button type="button" id="concept-tab-{{element.id}}" data-action="selectElementalConcept" data-element="{{element.id}}" class="iw-concept-tab {{#if element.selected}}active{{/if}} {{#if element.level}}learned{{/if}}" role="tab" aria-selected="{{#if element.selected}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}" aria-controls="concept-panel-{{element.id}}">{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/elemental-concept-icon.hbs" key=element.id}}<span>{{element.label}}</span><small>{{element.level}}</small></button>{{/each}}</div></section>{{/each}}
    </nav>
    <div class="iw-concept-workspaces">
      {{#each elemental.elements as |element|}}
      <section class="iw-concept-workspace" id="concept-panel-{{element.id}}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="concept-tab-{{element.id}}" data-element-workspace="{{element.id}}" {{#unless element.selected}}hidden{{/unless}}>
        <header class="iw-concept-heading">{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/elemental-concept-icon.hbs" key=element.id}}<div><span>{{element.category}}</span><h3>{{element.label}}</h3></div><div class="iw-concept-rank"><strong>{{element.level}}</strong><span>/ 10</span></div></header>
        <div class="iw-concept-comprehension"><div class="iw-element-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Compreensão de {{element.label}}" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuenow="{{element.level}}">{{#each element.segments}}<i class="{{#if this}}filled{{/if}}"></i>{{/each}}</div><p>{{element.resistance}}</p></div>
        <section class="iw-concept-training" aria-label="Treinamento de {{element.label}}">
          {{#if element.job}}<div class="iw-element-job"><strong>{{#if element.job.paused}}Treinamento pausado{{else}}Treinando nível {{element.job.targetLevel}}{{/if}}</strong><span>{{element.job.remainingDays}} dia(s) restante(s) · {{element.job.qiPerDay}} Qi Refinado por dia</span>{{#if element.job.paused}}<small role="status">{{element.job.reason}}</small>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="cancelElementalTraining" data-element="{{element.id}}" {{#unless @root.elemental.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Interromper treino</button></div>
          {{else}}{{#unless element.atMax}}<div class="iw-concept-training-title"><strong>Próximo nível: {{element.nextLevel}}</strong><span>Controle de Qi · Constituição</span></div><dl class="iw-element-cost"><div><dt>PC</dt><dd>{{element.ptCost}}</dd></div><div><dt>Qi / dia</dt><dd>{{element.cost.qi}}</dd></div><div><dt>CD</dt><dd>{{element.cd}}</dd></div><div><dt>Dias</dt><dd>{{element.cost.dias}}</dd></div></dl><button type="button" class="iw-element-train" data-action="trainElementalConcept" data-element="{{element.id}}" {{#unless element.canTrain}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="add"}}Treinar {{element.label}}</button>{{#unless element.canTrain}}<small class="iw-concept-requirement">{{element.hint}}</small>{{/unless}}{{#if element.failCount}}<small>{{element.failCount}} falha(s) neste nível{{#if (gte element.failCount 3)}} · próximas tentativas sem PC{{/if}}</small>{{/if}}{{else}}<p class="iw-element-complete">Compreensão completa</p>{{/unless}}{{/if}}
        </section>
        <header class="iw-concept-abilities-heading"><h4>Habilidades de {{element.label}}</h4><span><strong>{{element.available}}</strong> / {{element.level}} pontos livres</span></header>
        <div class="iw-concept-abilities">
          {{#each element.abilities as |ability|}}
          <details class="iw-element-ability {{#if ability.tier}}learned{{/if}}" data-element-section="ability-{{element.id}}-{{ability.id}}"><summary><span>{{ability.name}}{{#if ability.level10}}<small>Conceito nível 10</small>{{/if}}</span><span class="iw-element-tier">{{ability.tierLabel}}</span>{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="collapse"}}</summary><div class="iw-element-ability-body">
            {{#if ability.tier}}<section class="iw-concept-uses" aria-label="Usar {{ability.name}}">{{#each ability.activities as |activity|}}<button type="button" data-action="useIntegratedElementalAbility" data-item-id="{{activity.itemId}}" data-activity-id="{{activity.id}}" data-tooltip="{{activity.reason}}" {{#unless (and @root.elemental.editable activity.canUse)}}disabled{{/unless}}><span>{{activity.name}}</span><small>{{#each activity.actionMarks}}<svg class="iw-inline-action" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h10l5 9-5 9H7l-5-9Z"/></svg>{{/each}}{{activity.cost}}</small></button>{{/each}}{{#if ability.passive}}<p>Benefício passivo integrado à ficha.</p>{{else}}{{#each ability.capability.clauses}}<p class="iw-element-capability" data-capability="{{status}}">{{label}}</p>{{/each}}{{/if}}</section>{{/if}}
            {{#if ability.grants}}<section class="iw-element-grants" aria-label="Técnicas concedidas">{{#each ability.grants as |slot|}}<article class="{{#unless slot.active}}inactive{{/unless}}"><div><strong>{{slot.label}}</strong><small>{{slot.requirement}}</small><span>{{#if slot.techniqueName}}{{slot.techniqueName}}{{else}}Escolha uma técnica{{/if}}{{#unless slot.active}} · acesso suspenso{{/unless}}{{#if slot.missing}} · item não encontrado{{/if}}</span></div><div>{{#if slot.techniqueUuid}}<button type="button" data-action="openElementalGrant" data-uuid="{{slot.techniqueUuid}}">Abrir</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="createElementalGrant" data-slot="{{slot.id}}" {{#unless slot.canEdit}}disabled{{/unless}}>Criar</button><button type="button" data-action="assignElementalGrant" data-slot="{{slot.id}}" {{#unless slot.canEdit}}disabled{{/unless}}>Vincular</button></div></article>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}
            {{#each ability.descriptions as |description|}}<section class="iw-element-description {{#if description.active}}active{{/if}}"><h5>{{description.label}}</h5><div>{{{description.html}}}</div></section>{{/each}}
            {{#if ability.notes}}<aside class="iw-concept-resolution">{{#each ability.notes}}<p>{{this}}</p>{{/each}}</aside>{{/if}}
            <div class="iw-element-ability-actions">{{#if (lt ability.tier ability.maxTier)}}<button type="button" data-action="advanceElementalAbility" data-element="{{element.id}}" data-ability="{{ability.id}}" data-tooltip="{{ability.reason}}" {{#unless ability.canAdvance}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{> "systems/Immortals-system/templates/actors/parts/jj2-icon.hbs" key="add"}}{{ability.actionLabel}}</button>{{/if}}{{#if ability.tier}}<button type="button" class="iw-element-undo" data-action="undoElementalAbility" data-element="{{element.id}}" data-ability="{{ability.id}}" data-tooltip="{{ability.undoReason}}" {{#unless ability.canUndo}}disabled{{/unless}}>Reduzir grau</button>{{/if}}{{#if (and ability.ownedId @root.elemental.canGrant)}}<button type="button" class="iw-element-undo" data-action="openElementalAbility" data-item-id="{{ability.ownedId}}">Configurar</button>{{/if}}</div>
            {{#unless ability.canAdvance}}{{#if (lt ability.tier ability.maxTier)}}<small class="iw-concept-requirement">{{ability.reason}}</small>{{/if}}{{/unless}}
          </div></details>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer class="iw-concept-limit"><span>{{elemental.totalAbilities}} / {{elemental.maxAbilities}} habilidades aprendidas</span><span>{{elemental.uniqueAbilities}} / 1 habilidade única</span></footer>
</section>
